# Theoretical foundations of electrical engineering

**Authors:** V.G. Lyapin

## Abstract
The workbook contains exercises and methods of laboratory work in accord-ance with the curriculum of the education program of the baccalaureate's degree in the discipline "theoretical foundations of electrical engineering". Each section of the workbook includes the procedure for performing laboratory work, forms of reports on the work performed and control questions to check the level of knowledge. It is intended for bachelors studying in the areas ofeducation 13.03.02 "Elec-tric power industry and Electrical engineering" and 35.03.06 "Agroengineering

